rick and block walling, forming openings, closing cavities. selection and placement of wall ties, insulation, damp proof courses (DPCs), cavity trays, weep holes, lintels and fire stopping."},{"code":"K23","kind":"knowledge","title":"Brick on edge and soldier courses: setting out and construction techniques."},{"code":"K24","kind":"knowledge","title":"Defects and repair: Construction defects and repair methods."},{"code":"K25","kind":"knowledge","title":"Methods of protecting materials and work: Frost, water and construction damage."},{"code":"K26","kind":"knowledge","title":"Verbal communication techniques and construction terminology."},{"code":"K27","kind":"knowledge","title":"Principles of good team working."},{"code":"K28","kind":"knowledge","title":"Inclusion, equity and diversity in the workplace."},{"code":"K29","kind":"knowledge","title":"Methods of cutting bricks and blocks using hand tools."},{"code":"K30","kind":"knowledge","title":"Brick walls with raking cut: Setting out and construction techniques."},{"code":"K31","kind":"knowledge","title":"Well-being: Mental and physical health considerations in self and others and how to access support."},{"code":"S1","kind":"skill","title":"Comply with health and safety regulations, standards, and guidance."},{"code":"S2","kind":"skill","title":"Identify and use personal protective equipment (PPE)."},{"code":"S3","kind":"skill","title":"Comply with environmental and sustainability regulations, standards, and guidance. Segregate resources for reuse, recycling and disposal."},{"code":"S4","kind":"skill","title":"Comply with industry regulations, standards, and guidance."},{"code":"S5","kind":"skill","title":"Read and interpret information from drawings and specifications."},{"code":"S6","kind":"skill","title":"Estimate and select required resources: For example, the quantity of bricks and blocks, mortar, wall ties and insulation."},{"code":"S7","kind":"skill","title":"Prepare and maintain a safe working area."},{"code":"S8","kind":"skill","title":"Select and use hand tools."},{"code":"S9","kind":"skill","title":"Maintain and store hand tools."},{"code":"S10","kind":"skill","title":"Set out brick and block cavity wall to given tolerances, including an opening."},{"code":"S11","kind":"skill","title":"Construct a stretcher bond brick and block cavity wall with return and opening to given tolerances, including installing a lintel with soldiers, brick and edge sill, closure around opening, insulation, fire stopping, cavity tray, damp proof course (DPC) and weep holes."},{"code":"S12","kind":"skill","title":"Apply joint finishes: For example, half round, flush, weather struck and recessed."},{"code":"S13","kind":"skill","title":"Set out and construct a simple brick solid wall with capping."},{"code":"S14","kind":"skill","title":"Gauge and hand mix mortar to ratio."},{"code":"S15","kind":"skill","title":"Measure and cut bricks and blocks using hand tools, to given tolerances."},{"code":"S16","kind":"skill","title":"Carry out a simple repair: For example, replacing damaged bricks."},{"code":"S17","kind":"skill","title":"Protect materials and finished work."},{"code":"S18","kind":"skill","title":"Verbally communicate with others, applying construction terminology."},{"code":"S19","kind":"skill","title":"Follow equity, diversity and inclusion guidance."},{"code":"S20","kind":"skill","title":"Applies team working principles to their own and the wider build team."},{"code":"S21","kind":"skill","title":"Identifies well-being support available to self and others."},{"code":"S22","kind":"skill","title":"Construct a brick wall with raking cut. For example, gable end wall or garden wall with raking cut."},{"code":"B1","kind":"behaviour","title":"Put health, safety and wellbeing first."},{"code":"B2","kind":"behaviour","title":"Consider the environment when using resources and carrying out processes."},{"code":"B3","kind":"behaviour","title":"Take ownership of given work."},{"code":"B4","kind":"behaviour","title":"Contribute to an inclusive and diverse culture."},{"code":"B5","kind":"behaviour","title":"Seek learning and development opportunities."},{"code":"B6","kind":"behaviour","title":"Team-focus to meet team goals including, considering the wider build team."}]}$std$::jsonb, null);
    perform private.publish_standard(v);
  end if;
