tivities: British standards, building regulations and warranty provider standards."},{"code":"K8","kind":"knowledge","title":"Methods of interpreting and extracting relevant information from drawings and specifications."},{"code":"K9","kind":"knowledge","title":"Materials and their characteristics of home grown and imported timber and timber-based products. Natural timber products: Hardwood and softwood. Manufactured timber products: Board, laminated timber and carcassing."},{"code":"K10","kind":"knowledge","title":"Timber decay and repair methods: Timber moisture content parameters for a range of timber and timber-based materials, wet rot and dry rot, and insect attack."},{"code":"K11","kind":"knowledge","title":"Carpentry and joinery products and purpose: Mastics, preservatives, wood fillers, plastics and ironmongery."},{"code":"K12","kind":"knowledge","title":"Basic material estimation techniques, calculating lengths of timber, fixing requirements and a cutting list production methods."},{"code":"K13","kind":"knowledge","title":"Verbal communication techniques and construction terminology."},{"code":"K14","kind":"knowledge","title":"Hand tool use and storage methods and techniques: Chisels, planes, hand saws, hammers, squares, tri-square, bevels, marking and mortise gauges, spirit levels."},{"code":"K15","kind":"knowledge","title":"Hand tool maintenance and sharpening techniques."},{"code":"K16","kind":"knowledge","title":"Jig production techniques."},{"code":"K17","kind":"knowledge","title":"Power tools use and storage methods and techniques: Portable circular saws, drills, saws, planers, routers, sanders, multi-functional tools and nail guns."},{"code":"K18","kind":"knowledge","title":"Principles of good team working."},{"code":"K19","kind":"knowledge","title":"Inclusion, equity and diversity in the workplace."},{"code":"K20","kind":"knowledge","title":"Well-being: Mental and physical health considerations in self and others and how to access support."},{"code"